clpbar
------------------------------------------
Bar is a simple tool to process a stream of data and print a display for the
user on stderr showing the amount of data passed, the throughput of the data
transfer, and, if the total size of the data stream is known, estimated time
remaining, percent complete, and a progress bar.

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.12-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  autoconf-20260320-3
  automake-20260320-2
  binutils-2.47-1
  cygport-0.37.12-1
  gcc-core-14.4.0-1
  make-4.4.1-2

Canonical website:
  https://clpbar.sourceforge.net/

Canonical download:
  mirror://sourceforge/clpbar/clpbar/bar-1.11.1/bar_1.11.1.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack clpbar-1.11.1-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./clpbar-1.11.1-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/clpbar-1.11.1-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/clpbar-1.11.1-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(clpbar)
  /usr/bin/bar.exe
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/clpbar.README
  /usr/share/doc/clpbar/AUTHORS
  /usr/share/doc/clpbar/COPYING
  /usr/share/doc/clpbar/TODO
  /usr/share/man/man1/bar.1.gz

